# `packageIdentifier`

Returns the public package name `@sgx4u/{{packageName}}`. Replace this guide before the first release.

## Import

```ts
import { packageIdentifier } from "@sgx4u/{{packageName}}";
```

## Signature

```ts
function packageIdentifier(): PackageIdentifier
```

`PackageIdentifier` is the scoped package name.

## Accepted inputs

The stub takes no input.

## Examples

```ts
packageIdentifier(); // "@sgx4u/{{packageName}}"
```

## Edge cases

The stub does not throw.
